00:50:06.420 --> 00:50:08.500
Is it Empire Strikes Back?
是《帝国反击战》吗？

1141
00:50:09.320 --> 00:50:09.880
That...
那个……

1142
00:50:09.880 --> 00:50:11.620
Yes, where they're fighting each other.
是的，就是他们互相打斗的那部。

1143
00:50:11.820 --> 00:50:12.340
Yes.
没错。

1144
00:50:12.480 --> 00:50:16.280
And it is revealed that Darth Vader is Luke Skywalker's father.
而且真相大白，达斯·维达是卢克·天行者的父亲。

